### IDE extras ###
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/copilot.data.migration.ask2agent.xml
.idea/modules/

# IntelliJ database tooling — machine-local, never committed. dataSources.xml carries
# this workstation's JDBC hosts/ports/users (compose maps postgres to 5433, k8s does not),
# dataSources.local.xml the per-driver local state, and .idea/dataSources/ a ~400KB
# introspection cache of the live schema that regenerates on connect. Same rationale as
# .idea/workspace.xml above: IDE state, not project configuration.
.idea/dataSources.xml
.idea/dataSources.local.xml
.idea/dataSources/
.idea/db-forest-config.xml

# IntelliJ's JS library index — regenerated whenever the IDE re-scans node_modules, so it
# is per-workstation state, not project configuration. Same rationale as workspace.xml.
# The .idea files this repo DOES track are the shared ones (go.imports.xml, gradle.xml,
# vcs.xml); this is not one of them, and it has been showing up as untracked noise in
# `git status` for the whole session.
.idea/jsLibraryMappings.xml

